From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Henrik Klee <henrik@goat-code.com>
Date: Wed, 4 Nov 2026 01:38:26 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Input: apple_z2: Name the iPad 7 touchscreen for both models

The J172 match data serves both iPad 7 models: t8010-ipad7.dtsi gives
the J171 (iPad7,11) and the J172 (iPad7,12) the same
apple,j172-touchscreen compatible. Its input device name is
"iPad7,12 Touchscreen", so the J171's touchscreen is named after the
other model.

Name it "iPad 7 Touchscreen", which is true for both. Reported on a
J171 in OrchardLinux/orchard#35.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c | 2 +-
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 1 deletion(-)

diff --git a/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c b/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c
index f68295c..6d13af0 100644
--- a/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c
+++ b/drivers/input/touchscreen/apple_z2.c
@@ -4051,7 +4051,7 @@ static const struct apple_z2_chip_info apple_z2_j81_info = {
 };
 
 static const struct apple_z2_chip_info apple_z2_j172_info = {
-	.name = "iPad7,12 Touchscreen",
+	.name = "iPad 7 Touchscreen",
 	.variant = APPLE_Z2_VARIANT_J172,
 };
 
